Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: unicorn: disable unsupported QCE consumer

Linux marks CRYPTO_DEV_QCE as BROKEN. Disable its unbound interconnect
consumer so GCC/interconnect sync_state can complete. Keep secure-world
ownership and the remote-controlled crypto BAM unchanged. UFS ICE is a
separate engine and remains enabled.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn.dts
@@ -520,3 +520,8 @@
 };
 
 #include "sm8475-xiaomi-unicorn-nfc.dtsi"
+
+/* QCE has no usable Linux driver while CRYPTO_DEV_QCE is BROKEN. */
+&crypto {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
